https://github.com/EraserCN/OxygenToolbox
https://github.com/trinadhthatakula/Loki
https://github.com/hujiayucc/Fuck-AD # Primarily an Xposed ad-blocking module; Shizuku only feeds an auto-skip input path.
https://github.com/TACPR/com.liuml.apptimelimiter # LSPosed module requiring root/Xposed; Shizuku is only an optional force-stop executor.
https://github.com/limczhh/HyperLyric # libxposed/LSPosed module for HyperOS lyrics; Shizuku is only an optional standalone extra.
https://github.com/QXF19/JWSK # Chinese-only root manager bundling Magisk/KernelSU; Shizuku API is vendored, not consumed as an app feature.
https://github.com/LyraVoid/FolkPatch # KernelPatch-based root manager (APM/KPM/modules) requiring kernel-level flashing.
https://github.com/littleWhiteDuck/SimpleHook # LSPosed/Xposed module requiring a hooking framework; author redirects to HookNext successor.
https://github.com/LuckyPray/XAutoDaily # Xposed module for QQ auto check-ins; Shizuku is auxiliary.
https://github.com/oxohang/FanFreeform # LSPosed module requiring root on HyperOS 3; Shizuku only transitive dependency with no releases.
https://github.com/skysyaz/apextuner # Root-first CPU/GPU/thermal tuner where writes need root; Shizuku only an optional onboarding step.
https://github.com/JoyElliot/MiHealth_AmapFix # LSPosed module for Mi Fitness; Shizuku support is explicitly disabled in v2.1.
https://github.com/mingww64/lan-mouse-tv-cec # needs root
https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.liuml.apptimelimiter # LSPosed-first app-time limiter; Shizuku is only an optional force-stop executor, same app as ignored TACPR/com.liuml.apptimelimiter.
https://github.com/ldh-star/HesleyTools # Personal Magisk/KernelSU/LSPosed toolbox; Shizuku use unverifiable.
https://github.com/XPRAMT/RedMagicX # Denied in maintainer review
https://github.com/KanzakiK/libredex-public # Requires pre-existing root (Magisk/KernelSU) and LSPosed; README states 'The current product requires root', so Shizuku is not a standalone privilege path.
https://github.com/nowa277/OpenConverter # Protected-key extraction relies on root/Xposed-class privileged access.
https://github.com/sqxy090123/VulnKit # Local privilege-escalation / CVE root-exploit framework where Shizuku is only a root-shell backend.
https://github.com/Huai-Tian/ScreenshotFaker # LSPosed/Xposed module in early development with no regular download.
https://github.com/Sesame-AG/Sesame-AG # Xposed/LSPosed module requiring the Xposed framework; Shizuku is only a secondary shell path

